{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 40, :comments ["<b>Behold, I long</b> — like כליתי, from the abundance of love, like גם כלתה נפשי, and וכלות אליהם. Therefore מתאב אנכי is the opposite [sense]. Therefore חייני [is the consequence]."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 119, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:40:21.959381711Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}